 x, C (.of x) → C (.of x)⁻¹)\n    (mul : ∀ x y, C x → C y → C (x * y)) : C z :=\n  Quot.inductionOn z fun L ↦ L.recOn C1 fun ⟨x, b⟩ _tl ih ↦\n    b.recOn (mul _ _ (inv_of _ <| of x) ih) (mul _ _ (of x) ih)","start":625,"end":630},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}